</description>
<estimation>
| phase            | duration_weeks | cost_eur | confidence_pct |
|------------------|----------------|----------|----------------|
| Discovery        | 1              | 2,500    | 85             |
| Design           | 2              | 3,500    | 80             |
| Implementation   | 6              | 17,500   | 65             |
| QA               | 1              | 2,500    | 75             |
| Launch           | 1              | 1,500    | 80             |

Totals: 432 total_hours, 27,500 total_cost_eur, 11 total_duration_weeks.
Team: 1 product designer (part-time), 1 backend developer, 1 full-stack developer.
</estimation>
</example>

